## rights configuration
## more info: https://radicale.org/v3.html#authorization-and-rights


## Radicale WEB UI does not show other users' calendars even if 'rights' file allows access 


## Allow reading root collection for authenticated users
[root]
user: .+
collection:
permissions: Rr

[own-readwrite]
user: .+
collection: ^{user}(/.*)?
permissions: RWrw

[others-read]
user: .+
collection: ^(?!{user}/).+
permissions: Rr
